font-size: 10pt;\">본관 전시관</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">기초과학관 탐구교실</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">(1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">층</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">) / </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">전통과학관 탐구교실</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">(2</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">층</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp; ① </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">오전부터 참가하시는 분은 대강의실로 오세요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">. (</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">서주차장 주차</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">교육관 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">층</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 190%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pag